    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1116">

                <pb facs="1149" n="1139" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1139"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/9–2949: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >McConaughy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-29T20:00:00-05:00">September 29,
                            1949—8 p. m.</date> 2003.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Reurtel 4116, Sep 29. Pls keep Dept informed all available details Isbrandtsen
                    vessels, particularly geographical coordinates vessels <pb facs="1150" n="1140"
                        xml:id="pg1140"/> positions vicinity Tungsha buoy and any reported movements
                    from that area.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
